&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Senior Project Manager, Technical Services&lt;/strong&gt; is responsible for orchestrating Duetto&#39;s most complex global implementations and migrations, acting as central project owner and trusted advisor to mid-sized-to-enterprise and highly complex customers. This role serves as a strategic bridge across time zones, managing overlapping multi-property engagements while absorbing planning and decision-making that current cross-region coverage cannot sustain. The role carries no direct reports but is formally accountable for developing project management capabilities across the regional teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Makes Us Different?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Duetto is the hospitality industry&#39;s leading revenue management platform, founded in 2012 by former Wynn Resorts executives who knew the industry needed better technology. We built the world&#39;s first Revenue &amp;amp; Profit Operating System — a suite of tools (GameChanger, ScoreBoard, BlockBuster, Advance and more) that goes beyond room pricing to give hotels, resorts and casinos a complete picture of their revenue and profitability. Trusted by clients ranging from global chains to independent boutique hotels, we&#39;ve been named the #1 Revenue Management Software by HotelTechAwards four years running and the #1 Best Place to Work in Hotel Tech in 2025. Backed by GrowthCurve Capital since 2024, we&#39;re accelerating our investment in AI — and we&#39;re genuinely passionate about the industry we serve. We build products we&#39;re proud of, for customers we care about.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Orchestrate&lt;/strong&gt; strategic project delivery across overlapping, multi-property implementation and migration engagements — including delivery-date sequencing, workload smoothing, and portfolio-level planning across concurrent projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Direct&lt;/strong&gt; end-to-end deployment of enterprise and highly complex customer projects from kickoff through go-live.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Establish&lt;/strong&gt; and maintain client relationships, navigating difficult conversations with senior client leadership as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Anticipate,&lt;/strong&gt; document, and escalate project risks to ensure timely mitigation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Standardize&lt;/strong&gt; workflows and best practices to support consistent, scalable delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architect&lt;/strong&gt; cross-timezone coverage strategy, absorbing strategic planning and decision-making that current regional coverage cannot sustain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentor&lt;/strong&gt; and develop project management capability across the regional teams, building structured upskilling toward more strategic project ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Perform&lt;/strong&gt; other related duties as needed to support team and company priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;You may be a good fit if you have the following:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6-8 years Project management experience, ideally delivering revenue management or adjacent platform implementations, like PMS or CRS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on revenue management experience — you understand RM as both art and science, and how it drives real business decisions, not just as a concept you&#39;ve read about&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong fluency with a project management platform (&lt;a href=&quot;http://monday.com&quot;&gt;monday.com&lt;/a&gt; preferred) and the ability to make it work at scale for large, complex&amp;nbsp; multi-stakeholder customer projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An AI-forward working style — you already look for ways to use AI to move projects faster as a force multiplier and apply human judgment to validate outputs, maintain data integrity, and take full ownership of any AI-assisted work product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience owning executive-level, sometimes difficult, conversations with client stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to work independently across overlapping time zones, with schedule flexibility to overlap US West Coast working hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;French and/or Spanish fluency is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Duetto?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We&#39;re an AI-forward company across every function, not just engineering — you&#39;ll be equipped and encouraged to use cutting-edge AI tools to do your best work, and to help shape how the wider team uses them too&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Real growth trajectory: this role is built to deepen in strategic scope over time, not just in title&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A team that builds partnerships — with customers, and with each other — and shows up for one another to get the job done&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A genuinely global, come-as-you-are culture that takes hospitality, and having fun while delivering it, seriously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
